sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant ChatAPI as API Layer<br/>(ChatAPI)
    participant ChatOrch as Orchestration<br/>(ChatOrchestrator)
    participant LangGraph as Orchestration<br/>(LangGraphOrch)
    participant Extractor as State Management<br/>(Extractor)
    participant Validator as State Management<br/>(Validator)
    participant SAP as State Management<br/>(SAP)
    participant Embed as Knowledge<br/>(SentenceTransformer)
    participant Milvus as Knowledge<br/>(Milvus)
    participant Planner as Agent<br/>(Planner Agent)
    participant Writer as Agent<br/>(Writer Agent)
    participant Reviewer as Agent<br/>(Reviewer Agent)
    participant Ollama as LLM<br/>(Ollama)
    participant DocStruct as Document<br/>(Structure)
    participant Markdown as Document<br/>(Markdown)
    participant DOCX as Document<br/>(DOCXGen)
    participant FileAPI as API Layer<br/>(FileAPI)

    User->>ChatAPI: Send message
    ChatAPI->>ChatOrch: Forward conversation
    ChatOrch->>Ollama: Generate response
    Ollama-->>ChatOrch: Response/Questions
    ChatOrch-->>ChatAPI: Reply
    ChatAPI-->>User: Display

    User->>ChatAPI: Student progress/info
    ChatAPI->>LangGraph: Trigger document generation

    LangGraph->>Extractor: Extract progress claims
    Extractor->>Validator: Validate claims
    Validator->>SAP: Store in StudentState

    SAP->>Embed: Embed query topics<br/>(with student class_level)
    Embed->>Milvus: Search collection<br/>(documents_class_10 OR<br/>documents_class_12)
    Milvus-->>Embed: Retrieved context<br/>(class-specific)
    Embed-->>SAP: Embedded results

    SAP->>Planner: State + Context → Plan
    Planner->>Ollama: Generate plan
    Ollama-->>Planner: Plan nodes

    Planner->>Writer: Plan
    Writer->>Ollama: Generate sections (initial)
    Ollama-->>Writer: Content

    Writer->>Reviewer: Submit for review
    Reviewer->>Ollama: Quality check (iteration 1/2)
    Ollama-->>Reviewer: Feedback

    alt Issues Found & iteration < 2
        Reviewer->>Writer: Revision feedback
        Writer->>Ollama: Refine sections (with feedback)
        Ollama-->>Writer: Refined content
        Writer->>Reviewer: Submit refined sections
        Reviewer->>Ollama: Quality check (iteration 2/2)
        Ollama-->>Reviewer: Feedback
    end

    Reviewer->>DocStruct: Approved or Max iterations reached
    DocStruct->>Markdown: Format markdown
    DocStruct->>Markdown: Format markdown
    Markdown->>DOCX: Convert to .docx
    DOCX-->>FileAPI: Document file
    FileAPI-->>User: Download .docx